menuconfig DRIVERS_OLED_OLED_96X16_MODULE
			bool "OLED_96x16 OLED Display Driver Module"
					default n
			---help---
						Enable support for OLED_96x16 OLED display (96x16 monochrome)
						as a runtime-loadable driver module.
						This is separate from the board-integrated debug version
						(CONFIG_DRIVERS_OLED_OLED_96X16) which can be used for early boot debugging.
						This module version can be started/stopped at runtime and
						is useful for displaying status information during normal operation.
						Hardware: I2C-based OLED display (SSD1306 compatible subset)
						I2C Address: 0x3C (default)
						Usage:
						oled_96x16 start -X -b 1      # Start on external I2C bus 1
						oled_96x16 status             # Show status
						oled_96x16 test -t "Hello"    # Display text
						oled_96x16 stop               # Stop driver